that builds up over time.

00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:41.360 line:91%
Dust on the mirror
doesn't change the optics.

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:42.640 line:85%
It doesn't spoil the image.

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:43.680 line:85%
It just means that

00:07:43.680 --> 00:07:45.760 line:91%
some light
isn't reflected at all.

00:07:45.760 --> 00:07:48.400 line:91%
So over time, the image
gets less and less bright.

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:51.760 line:91%
I did get to see the
mirror recoating lab later.

00:07:51.760 --> 00:07:52.920 line:85%
<i>They'd just started to clean</i>

00:07:52.920 --> 00:07:54.200 line:91%
<i>one of the other
