00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:29.640 line:91%
<c.cyan>Yeah. Exactly.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>It's basically a hovercraft!</c>

00:08:29.640 --> 00:08:32.600 line:91%
<c.cyan>It is exactly
