00:08:35.040 --> 00:08:36.320 line:85%
<c.cyan>maybe we can go up to it.</c>

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:37.560 line:91%
Yeah, yeah. Let's go up.
<c.cyan>Do you want to go up?</c>

00:08:37.560 --> 00:08:38.800 line:85%
Yeah, absolutely.

00:08:38.800 --> 00:08:40.320 line:91%
<i>So what you can see
