00:09:33.240 --> 00:09:35.920 line:91%
<i>So it just seemed like the
best uniform for the job.</i>

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:37.600 line:85%
Oh, that is the mirror.

00:09:37.600 --> 00:09:40.280 line:91%
<c.cyan>Yeah, so we have a
