00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:01.000 line:91%
<c.cyan>also all the stains
that was collected</c>

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:03.080 line:85%
<c.cyan>during two years by the mirror.</c>

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:05.080 line:85%
<c.cyan>And then, we can start to do</c>

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:07.160 line:91%
<c.cyan>the stripping or
etching of the coating,</c>

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:10.680 line:91%
<c.cyan>using this rotating arm
to pour the acid</c>

00:10:10.680 --> 00:10:13.040 line:85%
<c.cyan>and to have the layer going out.</c>

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:15.360 line:91%
<i>So, wash the mirror
