00:10:15.360 --> 00:10:17.520 line:91%
<i>then acid etch the
old coating away,</i>

00:10:17.520 --> 00:10:18.640 line:85%
<i>and then...</i>

00:10:18.640 --> 00:10:19.960 line:91%
<c.cyan>When we have
