00:10:41.040 --> 00:10:43.120 line:85%
for industrial use.

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:45.480 line:91%
<c.cyan>And by the way,
there are some shutters.</c>

00:10:45.480 --> 00:10:47.880 line:91%
<c.cyan>It is closed, so we
cannot see the target.</c>

00:10:47.880 --> 00:10:51.200 line:91%
<c.cyan>The rainbow colours are some
