00:10:53.560 --> 00:10:55.000 line:85%
<c.cyan>then it's nice.</c>

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:57.120 line:85%
How much is being added here?

00:10:57.120 --> 00:11:01.520 line:91%
<c.cyan>The thickness of the coating
