00:11:12.280 --> 00:11:16.120 line:85%
<c.cyan>It's a 1,000 atoms' layer.</c>

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:17.960 line:91%
<c.cyan>One thousand.</c>
<i>(heavy exhale)</i>

