00:11:47.720 --> 00:11:48.520 line:85%
<c.yellow>Yes.</c>

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:49.800 line:91%
That's obviously
a lot more light

00:11:49.800 --> 00:11:51.320 line:85%
than it would normally get?

00:11:51.320 --> 00:11:52.920 line:85%
<c.yellow>You have the shutter in place.</c>

00:11:52.920 --> 00:11:54.320 line:91%
<c.yellow>So this, you know,
black curtain</c>

00:11:54.320 --> 00:11:55.760 line:85%
<c.yellow>that you have here is there</c>

00:11:55.760 --> 00:11:57.160 line:91%
<c.yellow>so no light's going
