00:11:59.040 --> 00:12:01.080 line:91%
Okay, yeah.
I can see that just there.

00:12:01.080 --> 00:12:03.840 line:91%
And I just noticed
the guide star lasers.

00:12:03.840 --> 00:12:05.080 line:91%
I know they've been
