00:12:27.440 --> 00:12:29.280 line:85%
<i>and it is so beautiful!</i>

00:12:29.280 --> 00:12:31.560 line:91%
<i>I've never seen
the stars this clearly!</i>

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:32.880 line:85%
<i>And they don't seem to twinkle,</i>

00:12:32.880 --> 00:12:34.160 line:91%
<i>'cause there's less
atmosphere up here</i>

00:12:34.160 --> 00:12:36.280 line:91%
<i>to cause that twinkling,
