00:12:36.280 --> 00:12:38.440 line:91%
The atmosphere isn't
one consistent thing.

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:40.560 line:91%
There are different temperatures
and pressures of air,

00:12:40.560 --> 00:12:42.280 line:85%
and the light gets refracted.

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:44.320 line:91%
It's not like wind
blowing balloons around.

00:12:44.320 --> 00:12:46.080 line:91%
The photons of light
aren't being blown away.

00:12:46.080 --> 00:12:47.560 line:85%
But it's the same reason that

00:12:47.560 --> 00:12:50.160 line:91%
an object in a swimming pool
