00:12:52.560 --> 00:12:54.200 line:91%
That's a difference
in the medium

00:12:54.200 --> 00:12:56.160 line:91%
that the light is
travelling through.

00:12:56.160 --> 00:12:57.760 line:85%
The different pockets of air

00:12:57.760 --> 00:13:00.560 line:91%
that are constantly moving
about in the upper atmosphere

00:13:00.560 --> 00:13:02.440 line:85%
cause the same sort of effect.

00:13:02.720 --> 00:13:04.320 line:85%
<i>That's why the stars twinkle.</i>

00:13:04.320 --> 00:13:06.200 line:91%
<i>The light is slightly
