00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:43.200 line:85%
<c.green>to correct the wavefront.</c>

00:13:43.200 --> 00:13:45.240 line:85%
Four lasers beamed out,

00:13:45.240 --> 00:13:48.200 line:91%
camera scanning exactly
