00:13:56.920 --> 00:13:58.960 line:91%
<c.green>And the idea behind
the adaptive optics</c>

00:13:58.960 --> 00:14:00.200 line:85%
<c.green>is to make that point source</c>

00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:02.400 line:91%
<c.green>as tight and as
