00:14:25.600 --> 00:14:27.320 line:85%
That's absolutely amazing.

00:14:27.320 --> 00:14:27.960 line:85%
<c.green>Yeah.</c>

00:14:27.960 --> 00:14:29.320 line:85%
Why four lasers?

00:14:29.320 --> 00:14:31.840 line:91%
<c.green>So, multiple lasers allows us
